<text x="15.24" y="391.16" size="1.524" layer="97" rot="R90">This can be used if your VESC is connected directly to the battery,
but you have a small BMS (10A,30A,.. for charging)
If the BMS shuts off, the receiver wont deliver a Servo signal anymore,
so the battery is not drained anymore</text>
