V2-1:
Initial</text>
<text x="147.32" y="457.2" size="1.778" layer="91">Changes to "normal" Rx:
EN_BMS_MEAS now permanent 3.3V, NC on AW9523
P_U1_MUX_1 permanent low, NC on AW9523
LED1, S1, S2 NC</text>
<text x="66.04" y="487.68" size="1.778" layer="91">In ESC0 Plug</text>
<text x="71.12" y="320.04" size="1.778" layer="91">OK replaced with level shift and-gates</text>
<text x="51.816" y="235.458" size="1.778" layer="91">G19:ESP-RX
G18:ESP-TX</text>
