<text x="-25.4" y="462.28" size="1.778" layer="91">Changes to "normal" Rx:
Remove dual direction lever shifter
Add translating shifter for GPS, direct connection for VESC
Mux S1 permanent low</text>
<text x="20.32" y="391.16" size="1.778" layer="91" rot="R90">Changes to "normal" Rx:
No resisor on PCB, need to add external </text>
